---
layout: layout.njk
title: "香水 | 气味档案"
description: "按品牌、香调、场景和价格筛选小众香水。"
pageKey: "shop"
permalink: shop.html
---

      <section class="page-hero shop-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">Fragrances</p>
        <h1>香水列表</h1>
        <p>从香调、场景、品牌和价格开始缩小范围，找到适合日常、礼物或收藏的气味。</p>
      </section>
      <section class="shop-layout section-tight">
        <form class="filters-panel" data-shop-filters>
          <label class="field-label">搜索关键词<input name="q" type="search" placeholder="茶香、木质、品牌名"></label>
          <div class="filter-group"><h2>香调</h2><div class="chip-group" data-note-filter></div></div>
          <label class="field-label">品牌<select name="brand" data-brand-filter></select></label>
          <label class="field-label">场景
            <select name="scene">
              <option value="all">全部场景</option>
              <option value="daily">日常通勤</option>
              <option value="date">约会</option>
              <option value="quiet">安静独处</option>
              <option value="gift">送礼</option>
              <option value="summer">夏天</option>
              <option value="sleep">睡前</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label class="field-label">分类
            <select name="category">
              <option value="fragrance">香水</option>
              <option value="home">空间香氛</option>
              <option value="all">全部商品</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <label class="field-label">价格
            <select name="price">
              <option value="all">全部价格</option>
              <option value="under600">¥600 以下</option>
              <option value="600to900">¥600 - ¥900</option>
              <option value="over900">¥900 以上</option>
            </select>
          </label>
          <button class="button button-secondary full" type="reset">清除筛选</button>
        </form>
        <div class="shop-results">
          <div class="result-toolbar"><p data-result-count>0 件作品</p><a class="text-link" href="samples.html">不确定？先试香</a></div>
          <div class="product-grid" data-shop-grid></div>
        </div>
      </section>
